    {
     "user": "Shakti Seals in Vadodara has quoted ₹10.40 for the 5-litre silicone gasket. Order 20,000 from them, cost centre PRD-07, need-by 2 November. Their GSTIN is 24AAFCS8812N1Z4.",
     "agent": "Purchase Policy §6.2: Parts that come into contact with food (gaskets, lids, body blanks and any other item marked food-contact in the item master) may be bought only from a supplier holding a valid food-grade certificate on file in Bahi. The certificate must be uploaded and checked before the first order is placed. An expired certificate counts as no certificate.\n\nWe cannot order silicone gaskets from Shakti Seals because they have no food-grade certificate in Bahi yet, which is required by Purchase Policy section 6.2 for parts touching food. Do you have their certificate? Please send its reference number and expiry date.",
     "services": [
      "itm_search",
      "itm_search",
      "itm_get",
      "sup_search",
      "sup_search",
      "sup_search",
      "cc_get",
      "bud_check"
